1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 18th generation. Approximately 1745 BC to ____. Son of Lei (耒).
2 CONT
2 CONT Conferred title of Lord of Huang State (封黄国公) in 1706 BC (后泄二十一年).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the reign of Xia Emperor Xie (夏帝泄, 1730 BC to 1706 BC) of the Xia (夏) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Fen (芬).
2 CONT
2 CONT 十八世。约公元前1745 ---。耒之子, 芬之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 夏帝泄 (公元前1730 - 公元前1706) 时夷族受夏爵命, 萃公在大概公元前1706左右被封黄国公, 封地约百里。第二个古黄国地址在今山东省黄县。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
