1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 32nd Ancestor: 亞今 (Yà Jīn)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 1451 BC. He was the 御侍郎 (Yù Shì Láng). His tomb was located at the East of 蛇子岭 (Shé Zi Lǐng), 毫地 (Háo De).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, 干 (Gàn) gave birth to 褔 任 (Fù Rèn) and 亍寵 (Chù Chǒng) while his concubine, Ms. An, had a son named 保華 (Bǎo Huá) and two daughters.
