1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 34th Ancestor: 仁才 (Rén Cái)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 1381 BC. He was the 太守 (Tài Shǒu). He was buried at the West of 子午谷 (Zǐ Wǔ Gǔ), 殷地 (Yīn De),當陽 (Dāng Yáng), Henan with his two wives.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wives were 成 (Chéng) and 能 (Néng).
2 CONT
2 CONT 成 (Chéng)'s sons were 進林 (Jìn Lín) and 福山 (Fú Shān). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 能 (Néng) had a son named 有國 (Yǒu Guó) and two daughters.
