2 CONT He was born in 1190 BC. He was an officer of the 商 (Shāng) Dynasty. He was buried at the East of 小盤嶺 (Xiǎo Pán Lǐng) with his wife.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wives were 從 (Cóng) and 白 (Bái). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 從 (Cóng) had a son named 振興 (Zhèn Xīng) and two daughters.
2 CONT
2 CONT 白 (Bái) had a son named 振林 (Zhèn Lín) and a daughter. No record shows where 白 (Bái) was buried.
