1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 41st generation. Approximately 1120 BC to _____. Son of Fu Tan (父坛).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Supreme Imperial Official in charge of Military Affairs (太尉) during the Shang (商)/Zhou (周) period. His eldest son adopted Yue (约) as his family name. This was recorded in the Yue family record.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Yin Que (音確).
2 CONT
2 CONT 四十一世。约公元前1120 ---。父坛之子, 音確之父。商/周时代为校尉. 其长子以约为氏, 次子觷 (音確/鲎)。
2 CONT
