1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 50th generation. Approximately 895 BC _____. Son of Lv (履).
2 CONT
2 CONT An Imperial Investigative Court Official (畿内闾正) during the Western Zhou (西周) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 5 sons. One of them was Rui Bo (芮伯).
2 CONT
2 CONT 五十世。约公元前895 ---。履之子, 芮伯之父。周朝时为畿内闾正 (闾胥)。
2 CONT
2 CONT 时周懿王 (公元前899 - 公元前892) 徒于槐里, 王室衰微。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
