1 NAME Ruì Bó /HUANG 黄芮伯 51A/
2 GIVN Ruì Bó
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄芮伯 51A
1 NAME HUANG Rui Bo, 黄芮伯 51A
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 51st generation. Approximately 865 BC to _____. Eldest son of Chen (辰).
2 CONT
2 CONT A General (征军大将) during the reign of Zhou Xuan Wang (周宣王, 827 BC - 782 BC). Helped to quell the uprising of the Huai tribe (淮夷) with Zhao Hu (召虎) around 820 BC.
2 CONT
2 CONT Designated Minister of Instruction (司徒) by Zhou Wang (周王) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Spring-Autumn (春秋) period. Composed the satirical poem "Mulberry Trees" (作桑柔之诗). His eldest son adopted Rui (芮) as his family name.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Kao (考).
2 CONT
2 CONT 五十一世。约公元前865 ---。辰之子, 考之父。周宣王时 (公元前827 - 公元前782) 为征军大将, 与召公虎平定淮夷 (约公元前820)。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  黄正瑞的博客.
