2 CONT
2 CONT Preceded by Zhuang Bo of Quwo Ruler of Quwo
2 CONT  716–679 BC Merged into Jin  Preceded by Min as Marquis of Jin Duke of Jin
2 CONT  678–677 BC Succeeded by Duke Xian of Jin 
