1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 58th generation ancestor: Qiyi (祁義) / (祁義)''' - Page 248
2 CONT
2 CONT Qiyi's county was destroyed by Qi Huan Gong (齊桓公) in 684 BC。His wife Ms. Hu (胡) had two sons named Kejin (克錦) and Kezheng (克正).
2 CONT
2 CONT The 58th generation ancestor Qiyi (祁義) was born during the Western Zhou Dynasty, 689 BC. He ran to Ju County with his father, then moved to Hongnong (弘農), Jiangxi (江西) and Nanchang (南昌). He was buried north of Ziling (子嶺). Qiwu (祁
2 CONC 武) was a Daifu (大夫).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Ms. Hu (胡) had two sons named Kejin (克錦), Kezheng (克正) and a daughter. She was buried at the east of White Horse Mountain Range (白馬嶺) in Shibu (石埠).
2 CONT
2 CONT (He is the progenitor of the 譚 surname after the State of Tan was extinguished in 0684 BCE.)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Google Translation:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第58代祖先：祁義（祁義）/（祁義'''）-第248頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 公元前684年，齊桓公毀了齊義縣。他的妻子胡女士有兩個兒子，分別是克錦和克正。
2 CONT
2 CONT 58世代祖先祁義（Qiyi）出生於西元前689年。 他和父親一起跑到Ju縣，然後搬到弘農，江西和南昌。 他被安葬在子嶺（Ziling）的北部。 祁武（Qiwu）是大夫（Daifu）。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的妻子胡女士有兩個兒子，分別是克錦（Kejin），克正（Kezheng）和一個女兒。 她被埋在石埠的白馬嶺（White Horse Mountain Range）的東部。
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Original Entry -  https://wenku.baidu.com/view/1fcd44560912a21615792914.html'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 谭氏始祖。生于东周庄王八年（公元前689年）。长大后尊父命至洛邑报周天子，庄王认为无错，留子爵。留居洛邑。卒葬石埠白马岭东。生二子一女。
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Google Translation:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT The ancestor of the Tan family. Born in the eighth year of the king of Eastern Zhouzhuang (689 BC). When he grew up, he respected his father and sent him to Luoyi to report to the emperor Zhou. King Zhuang believed that there was 
2 CONC nothing wrong with him and kept the Viscount. Stay in Luoyi. The death was buried in Shibu Baimaling East. Have two sons and a daughter.
