1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 59th generation ancestor: Kejin (克名)''' - Page 248 to 249
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born during the Eastern Zhou, 649 BC. He was buried at Shibu (石埠), the south of Baihua Mountain (百花嶺) with his wife, Qiwu, who was conferred to be the Daifu by Emperor Zhuang (莊王), had administrated army events for more tha
2 CONC n thirty years. So was called Tan Bo (譚伯), later he was killed at 636 BC because his sons brought a disaster on him.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Ms. Chen (陳) had two sons named Shichun (世春), Chunfa (春發) and two daughters. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Google Translation:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第59代祖先：克名（Kejin）'''-第248頁至249頁
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於公元前649年的東周。 他與妻子齊武一起被葬在百花嶺以南的石埠，他的妻子齊武由莊王任命為戴夫，他已經管理了三十多年的軍事活動。 因此被稱為譚伯（Tan Bo），後來他在公元前636年被殺，因為他的兒子給他帶來了災難。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的妻子陳女士有兩個兒子，分別是世春，春發和兩個女兒。
