1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 60th generation ancestor: Shichun (世春)''' - Page 249
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 616 BC, during the Eastern Zhou Dynasty. He was buried at Shangtang (上塘), at Fozi Gang (佛子崗) facing towards the south.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, Ms. Fang (万) had two sons named Zhanxing (占興), Zhanmei (占梅) and a daughter. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Google Translation:
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第60代祖先：世春'''（Page 249）
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於公元前616年的東周朝。 他被安葬在朝南的佛子崗（Fozi Gang）的上塘（Shangtang）。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的妻子方女士（Fang）有兩個兒子，分別是佔興（Zhanxing），占美（Zhanmei）和一個女兒。
