1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 59th generation. Approximately 675 BC to _____. Son of Yi (繄).
2 CONT
2 CONT An Official (大正) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Spring-Autumn (春秋) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Ji Fu (吉甫).
2 CONT
2 CONT 五十九世。约公元前675 ---。繄之子, 吉甫之父。东周/春秋时期为人正 (应为大正, 司寇)。
2 CONT
2 CONT 擘藩, 大藩盛。希望能够大大地繁荣昌盛, 振兴家声。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  黄正瑞的博客.
