1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 60th generation. Approximately 650 BC to _____. Son of Fan (藩).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Spring-Autumn (春秋) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Shi (适).
2 CONT
2 CONT 六十世。约公元前650 ---。藩之子, 适之父。时周襄王四年癸酉 (公元前648), 黄国被楚国并吞。
2 CONT
2 CONT 吉甫, 古时对男子的美称。
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - Huang State (黄国) was destroyed by Chu Cheng Wang (楚成王) of the Chu State (楚国) in 648 BC.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
