1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 62nd generation ancestor: Xiyi (希亦)''' - Page 250
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 552 BC during Eastern Zhou Dynasty. He moved to Hunan (湖南). His tomb is located at the south of Fengling (鳳嶺), Ma River (馬江), Hunan (湖南).
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife Ms Zhu (朱) had four sons Huide (惠德), Rude (儒德), Jide (積德) and Biaode (標德). She was buried at Jingshan Ling (京山領) facing the north. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Google Translation:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''第62代祖先：希亦'''（Page 250）
2 CONT
2 CONT 他出生於公元前552年的東周朝。 他移居湖南。 他的墓位於湖南湖南馬江的鳳嶺南部。
2 CONT
2 CONT 他的妻子朱女士有四個兒子惠德（Hude），儒德（Rude），積德（Jide）和標德（Biaode）。 她被安葬在朝北的京山領（Jingshan Ling）。
