1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 63rd generation. Approximately 575 BC to _____. Son of Shu Liang (叔梁)/Quan (权).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Senior Minister of Education (大司徒) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Warring States (战国) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT The generations from Jian (囏) to Chui (垂) are recorded in the family record of Huang Quan (黄权宗辦).
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Xi (息).
2 CONT
2 CONT 六十三世。约公元前575 ---。 叔梁之子, 息之父。东周/战国时期为大司农。
2 CONT
2 CONT 公元前648黄国为楚所灭, 黄国原为周朝的边垂, 取名为“垂”, 意思为不忘旧国。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
