1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''The 67th Generation Ancestor: 軒冕 (Xuān Miǎn)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born in 388 BC. He moved to 湖北 (Húběi) from 湖南 (Húnán). He was the general of Chu County.
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife, 馬 (Ms. Mǎ) had two sons named 伍相 (Wǔ Xiāng) and 明相 (Míng Xiāng). She was buried at the opposite side of 界牌店 (Jiè Pái Diàn), 安陸 (ān lù) of  湖北 (Húběi) with her husband.
