1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 66th generation. Approximately 500 BC to _____. Son of Chi (炽).
2 CONT
2 CONT A First Minister (上卿) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Warring States (战国) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 3 sons. Chen (陈) was the youngest.
2 CONT
2 CONT 六十六世。约公元前500 ---。炽之子, 陈之父。东周/战国时期为执正 (政) 上卿。
2 CONT
2 CONT 时在战国初, 执正 (政) 上卿就是宰相, 后代以宰代其名。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
