1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 67th generation. Approximately 475 BC to _____. 3rd and youngest son of Zai Kong (宰孔). Name could be Dong (栋).
2 CONT
2 CONT Was conferred the title of  Marquis of Chenping (陈平侯) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Warring States (战国) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Tuo (妥).
2 CONT
2 CONT 六十七世。约公元前475 ---。宰孔之子, 妥之父。东周/战国时期封陈平侯。
2 CONT
2 CONT 战国有宰相春平侯, 估计“栋” (陈) 当时在周朝任宰相, 被封为“陈平侯”。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
