1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 70th generation. Approximately 400 BC to _____. Son of Pian (扁). Also known as Fu Shu Gong (父叔弓) and Jing Xiu (景修).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Prefectural Official (君邑正天下大夫) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Warring States (战国) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT The generations from Chui (垂) to Fu Shu Gong are recorded in the family record of Bo Zi Zong (伯子宗法传).
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Hao (浩).
2 CONT
2 CONT 七十世。约公元前400 ---。扁之子, 浩之父。东周/战国时期为下大夫。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
