1 NAME Dà Gāng /HUANG 黄大綱 75A/
2 GIVN Dà Gāng
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄大綱 75A
1 NAME HUANG Da Gang, 黄大纲 75A
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE -168
1 BIRT
2 DATE -240
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 75th generation. 240 BC to 168 BC. Son of You Chong (幼冲). Also known as Ao (敖) and Ji Zhong (极忠).
2 CONT
2 CONT Grew up in Gu Shi County (固始县). Was already skilled in calligraphy by age 9. When his father was killed in 213 BC, Da Gang (大纲) was 28 years old. In 209 BC, at age 32, Da Gang joined Liu Bang (刘邦) to rebel against the Qin (秦) Empe
2 CONC ror and helped to establish the Han (汉) Dynasty. He was conferred the title of Marquis (江夏侯) in 195 BC, at age 46.
2 CONT
2 CONT 七十五世。公元前240 - 公元前168。幼冲之子, 公卿之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 汉高祖三年 (公元前204), 任光州刺史, 有善政; 六年 (公元前201), 汉置江夏郡, 十二年 (公元前195), 高祖巡狩光州, 以大纲优异, 封江夏侯, 兄弟皆赐三公之服。居光州固始县 (河南光州)。黄氏江夏郡最早名于此。
2 CONT
2 CONT 公元前213年黄幼冲被杀时, 黄大纲已28岁。公元前209, 三十二岁的黄大纲, 怀着国恨家仇积极参加刘邦反秦大业功勋卓越。公元前195 (黄大纲46岁) 封江夏侯。 
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄正瑞博客.
