1 NAME HUANG Ji Zong, 黄季宗 79A
1 SEX M
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 79th generation. Approximately 100 BC - 21 BC. Son of Ba (霸). Also known as Shang (赏).
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 2 sons. Lu (禄) was the 2nd son.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the Western Han (西汉) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marquis of Zhongqu (中曲) and Lieutenant of Guandu (关都). Conferred posthumous title of Sihou (思侯). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 七十九世。约公元前100 - 公元前21。霸之子, 禄之父。又名黄赏。
2 CONT
2 CONT 封中曲侯, 官至关都尉。谥为思侯。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄氏宗亲网 - 黄霸公世系 (淮阳阳夏). 世系说法四 : 福建莆田渭庄黄氏.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄霸 - 百度百科.
