1 NAME Xiāng /HUANG 黄香 81A/
2 GIVN Xiāng
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄香 81A
1 NAME HUANG Xiang, 黄香 81A
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 68
1 DEAT
2 DATE 122
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 81st generation. Approximately 68 to 122. Son of Lu (禄). Lived in Jiang Xia An Lu (江夏安陆), present day Yun Meng in Hubei (湖北云梦). Also known as Wen Jiang (文疆-字).
2 CONT
2 CONT Highly regarded by Emperor Han Zhang Di (汉章帝). Chancellor (佐丞相) and Imperial Secretariat (尚书令) during the reign of Han Zhang Di. Upon retirement, offered but declined the appointment of Governor (太守) of the Dong Commandery (东郡), o
2 CONC pting to remain as the Director of the Imperial Secretariat. Was rewarded with 300,000 coins (钱) by Emperor Han He Di (汉和帝).
2 CONT
2 CONT Famous for his filial piety (long mourning of his mother who died when he was aged 9) and kindness as well as his literary skills.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 4 wives - Madam Li (李氏), Madam Zheng (郑氏), Madam Lu (陆氏) and Madam Hu (胡氏) - and 8 sons - Qiong (琼), Gui (瑰), Lian (琏), Li (理), Chen (琛), Zan (瓒), Ke (珂) and Liu (琉).
2 CONT
2 CONT 八十一世。约公元68 -公元122。禄之子, 琼之父。字文疆。东汉孝子, 官至左承相, 尚书令, 迁魏郡太守。
2 CONT
2 CONT 九齡母丧。事父至孝。以儒学人仕, 初任郎中, 汉章帝 (公元76 - 公元88) 诏见黄香, 让他入东观 (国家图书馆), 读尽皇家藏书。后宫拜尚书郎, 汉章帝 (公元84) 对群臣说 : "此天下无双江夏黄童也", 群臣莫不侧目。和帝永元四年(公元92), 升为左承相, 两年后又升为尚书令。经汉章帝, 和帝两朝, 黄香一直受皇家亲重, 至和帝去世, 安帝即位 (公元106), 黄香出任魏郡太守, 不数年, 因郡内水灾免职, 旋即去世。葬江夏郡安陆云梦北郊
2 CONC 源口, 配夫人李氏, 郑氏, 陆氏, 胡氏。子八, 琼, 瑰, 琏, 理, 琛, 瓒, 珂, 琉。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - 1. An internet source, 黄氏家族, indicates that Huang Xiang (黄香) lived between AD 18 and AD 106. These dates were not used. His eldest son, Huang Qiong (黄琼), was born in AD 86, putting Huang Xiang as 68 years old when he first be
2 CONC came a father. That would be rather implausible. Moreover, Huang Xiang went on to father another 7 sons and, perhaps, an unrecorded number of daughters.
2 CONT       -  2.  According to the website 黄正瑞的博客, Huang Xiang's father was Huang Kuang, 黄况 (30 - 90). For the purpose of my Family Tree here, I have adopted the record in our Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. 黄氏宗亲网 - 黄霸公世系 (淮阳阳夏). 世系说法四 : 福建莆田渭庄黄氏.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Webpages on Huang Xiang (黄香).
