1 NAME Qióng /HUANG 黄瓊 82A/
2 GIVN Qióng
2 _MARNM HUANG 黄瓊 82A
1 NAME HUANG Qiong, 黄琼 82A
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 86
1 DEAT
2 DATE 164
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 82nd generation. 86 to 164. Eldest son of Xiang (香). Also known as Shi Ying (世英-字).
2 CONT
2 CONT Initially served as Secretary to the Crown Prince (太子舍人) by virtue of his father's position. Later became Director of the Secretariat (太尉) and Grand Commandant (司空). Was granted the title of Marquis of Yuanxiang (邧乡侯) in charge of
2 CONC  a thousand families. Subsequently made CheqI General (车骑将军) and given the posthumous name of Zhonghou (忠侯).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived in Jiang Xia An Lu (江夏安陆) during the Eastern Han (东汉) Dynasty. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 3 wives - Madam Li (李氏), Madam Liu (刘氏) and Madam Hu (胡氏) and 14 sons - Shou Liang (守亮), Ge(阁), Tuo (妥), Chu (储), Jian (贱), Ming (明), Nu (怒), Qian (乾), Jin (缙), Qing (卿), Ben (贲), Zi (资), Zan (赞) and De (德).
2 CONT
2 CONT 八十二世。公元86 - 公元164。黄香之长子,  恩荣之父。字世英。
2 CONT
2 CONT 初以父任为太子舍人, 復拜为太尉, 封邧乡侯, 邑千户, 旋首居公位, 为司空, 卒年79, 诏车骑将军, 死后封为忠侯。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. 维基百科.
